  "description": "737NG autobrake and flaps (reads the plane's own data, FIPinator Live only): AUTO BRAKE selector RTO-MAX with DISARM light, flap dial UP to 40 following the flaps, LE FLAPS TRANSIT and EXT lights. Needs FIPinator Live, with data sharing switched on in the add-on\u0027s options.",
